    "body": "Problem: When a split window is created from the init script using nvim_open_win() with enter=false, the current window focus is not preserved. The cursor incorrectly moves into the newly created split during startup.\r\n\r\nSolution: Save curwin before the iteration loop in create_windows(), and restore it after the loop. also update edit_buffers() to use curwin instead of firstwin.\r\n\r\nFix #34693\r\n",
    "closed_at": "2026-07-12T16:30:40Z",
    "comment_data": [],
    "comment_regular_data": [
