            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "I think the diff looks OK? Still unsure if this needs changing, but I suppose this makes sense; someone else ought to take a look, though.\r\n\r\n(Also as noted in https://github.com/neovim/neovim/issues/34693#issuecomment-3015983584 this isn't unique to Nvim or `nvim_open_win`)",
